<view class="page yc-page">
  <page-heading eyebrow="经营管理" title="门店首次初始化" description="仅供新门店首次启用，已有历史数据不可覆盖。" /><view class="card">仅供新门店首次启用，录入开始营业前的实际资金和库存。已有盘点、单据或非零余额的门店不能覆盖初始化。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">正在读取选项…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="card">{{notice}}</view><block wx:if="{{!loading}}"><button bindtap="reload" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">重新读取门店与票种</button><view class="card"><picker range="{{departments}}" range-key="name" value="{{deptIndex}}" bindchange="department" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"><view class="choice">{{deptIndex >= 0 ? departments[deptIndex].name : '请选择门店'}}</view></picker><button bindtap="verify" disabled="{{busy || deptIndex < 0}}">核对初始化状态</button><view wx:if="{{status.reason}}" class="hint">{{status.reason}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{pending}}" bindtap="retryPending" disabled="{{busy}}">以同一请求核对并重试上次提交</button><block wx:if="{{status.canInitialize && !pending}}"><view class="card"><view class="heading">五类资金初始余额</view><view wx:for="{{fundFields}}" wx:key="key" class="field"><view>{{item.label}}（元）</view><input type="digit" value="{{funds[item.key]}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}" maxlength="13"/></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">选择票种并填写初始库存</view><view class="hint">至少选择一个票种，无库存填零。价格取已配置的票种资料。</view><checkbox-group bindchange="select"><view wx:for="{{materials}}" wx:key="id" class="stock"><label><checkbox value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{item.selected}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>{{item.materialName}}</label><view class="hint">每包 {{item.price}} 元 · 每张 {{item.money}} 元</view><block wx:if="{{item.selected}}"><view>整包数<input type="number" value="{{item.packageNum}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="packageNum" bindinput="count" disabled="{{busy}}" maxlength="7"/></view><view>散张数<input type="number" value="{{item.sheetNum}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="sheetNum" bindinput="count" disabled="{{busy}}" maxlength="7"/></view></block></view></checkbox-group></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">启用说明</view><textarea value="{{reason}}" data-key="reason" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}" maxlength="500" placeholder="填写实际启用情况和核对说明，至少5个字"/></view><button type="primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">确认首次初始化</button></block><button wx:if="{{!departments.length}}" bindtap="load">重新读取选项</button></block></view>
